-                &lt;use&gt;, &lt;image&gt;, &lt;switch&gt;, &lt;a&gt; and &lt;text&gt;. In all
-                cases, the type is a rotation and all the elements should rotate together about
-                their centers, for 3s, starting at the document's load time.
-            </Paragraph>
-            <Paragraph>
