-<!-- Test which verifies the basic facilities of feFlood, feMerge,        -->
-<!-- and feOffset.                                                        -->
-<!--                                                                      -->
-<!-- Author : Peter Graffagnino 15-Aug-2000, Thomas DeWeese 5-Feb-2002    -->
